  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】秋田県といえばコレ！きりたんぽ・比内地鶏・銘酒「新政」＆乳頭温泉・男鹿温泉おすすめ宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🍲 囲炉裏で味わうきりたんぽ鍋と比内地鶏！世界が注目する銘酒「新政」の聖地</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">美肌と美酒の国・秋田県。日本三大美味鶏「比内地鶏」の出汁が染み渡る「きりたんぽ鍋」、喉越しの良い「稲庭うどん」。日本酒界のトップランナー「新政」「ゆきの美人」。乳頭温泉郷の秘湯や男鹿半島の日本海絶景とともに贅沢な時間を楽しめます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 秋田県を代表する最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">秋田キャッスルホテル</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.46</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/588/588.jpg\" alt=\"秋田キャッスルホテル 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 日本海を一望する絶景露天風呂と男鹿名物「石焼料理」！秋田銘酒の夕べ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">男鹿温泉郷の海沿い名宿。真っ赤に焼けた小石を木桶に放り込んで沸騰させる迫力の郷土料理「石焼鍋」や比内地鶏、秋田の銘酒が自慢。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、温泉通、豪快な郷土料理と日本海の夕日を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>名物石焼料理の実演と日本海パノラマ温泉なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D588\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】秋田キャッスルホテル の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
